  "title": "Meatiest Vegetarian Chili from Your Slow Cooker",
  "description": "This simple slow cooker tofu chili features crushed tomatoes, bell peppers, black beans, and spices that cook all day for a filling vegetarian meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Simone"
  ],
